      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### START HERE - Human ComfyUI Workflow\nPaste or edit the cue sheet in cue_sheet_text. Set audio_path to the 2-hour mix inside ComfyUI input. Press Queue.\nPreview Batch Plan shows timestamp splits before/during a run. Batch Images / Job Status shows generated image thumbnails and chunk status from the latest job.\nSet max_chunks to 2 for a quick test; set it back to 0 for the full mix. To refresh status without launching a new job, set launch_now=false and Queue."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        700,
        -120
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "OUTPUTS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Outputs\nThe status node shows the job folder after Queue.\nLook in output/longform_yvann/job_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS/\n- images/ generated batch images\n- videos/ rendered chunks\n- final/final_concat.mp4 joined result\nQueue again with launch_now=false to refresh the image/status view."
      ]
    },
